1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Count the roof beasts. Only one hall in China has all 10.
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:07,000
Those little figures on a palace roof ridge aren't just decoration.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,000
The more of them, the higher the building's rank - most halls stop at 3, 5 or 7.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,500
Only the Forbidden City's Hall of Supreme Harmony gets the full 10.

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,500
Double-tap if you'd have counted every one.

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,500
And the 10th - hangshi, a winged guardian - sits on no other roof in China.

7
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Did you count 10?
